-- ===========================================================================
-- Warlock (Affliction): Fel Concentration -- reconstruct the missing SQL
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- Fel Concentration was applied straight to the live database and never got a
-- tracked .sql file.  Everything below already exists in the developer's
-- acore_world, so this file changes nothing locally -- but without it a fresh
-- database, a clean clone or any other machine silently reverts the talent to
-- stock pushback resistance, and spell_warl_fel_concentration loads and never
-- fires.  tools/verify_scripts.py caught the registration half; the DBC half
-- had no symptom at all.
--
-- The rows are dumped verbatim from the live table rather than regenerated,
-- so this is a faithful copy of what was actually being tested, not a
-- reimplementation from the design notes.
--
-- The design (see modules/world_of_alonecraft/src/WarlockDrainChanneling.cpp):
--   Fel Concentration (17783 / 17784 / 17785) was pure casting-pushback
--   resistance, which Alonecraft removes globally, so the talent did nothing.
--   It now reduces damage taken by 10 / 20 / 30% while channeling Drain Soul
--   or Drain Life.
--
--   The talent ranks are bare SPELL_AURA_DUMMY carriers; the actual damage
--   reduction lives in buff spells 200523 / 200524 / 200525, which the script
--   casts on channel start and removes on channel end.  The channel aura sits
--   on the TARGET, so interrupt, target death and range break all drop the
--   buff with no timer in C++.
--
-- NOTE ON FILE NUMBERING: WarlockDrainChanneling.cpp and
-- woa_2026_08_06_05.sql originally referred to this content as
-- woa_2026_08_06_04.sql.  That slot was taken by the Mark of Gul'dan proc
-- retune before this file was written; both comments have been corrected to
-- point here.
-- ===========================================================================


-- ============================================================
-- Talent ranks + damage-reduction buffs
-- ============================================================
-- 17783 / 17784 / 17785 -- talent ranks, DUMMY carriers
-- 200523 / 200524 / 200525 -- the 10 / 20 / 30% damage reduction buffs

DELETE FROM `alonecraft_spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (17783, 17784, 17785, 200523, 200524, 200525);
